WEBVTT

00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:10.790
This is bad...

00:00:10.790 --> 00:00:12.900
The whole damn Story Zone's falling apart!

00:00:14.140 --> 00:00:16.780
Wait! If you do the tuning 
now, Aladdin will...

00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:19.370
Hate me if you want.

00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:54.550
Aladdin of the Burning Sand

00:01:55.900 --> 00:01:58.840
We came to a new Story Zone...

00:02:00.030 --> 00:02:01.720
and found ourselves in a desert!

00:02:01.920 --> 00:02:04.730
We need to find water soon.

00:02:04.730 --> 00:02:09.100
I'm... I'm drying up!

00:02:11.740 --> 00:02:13.890
Boss, hang in there!

00:02:13.890 --> 00:02:15.570
You can do it! I know you can!

00:02:15.790 --> 00:02:19.090
I... I can do it...

00:02:21.550 --> 00:02:24.270
Somebody... Water...

00:02:24.270 --> 00:02:27.200
You want some water, miss?

00:02:27.810 --> 00:02:29.310
Here you go!

00:02:29.310 --> 00:02:32.210
It'll bring you back to life and make 
you feel like you're in heaven.

00:02:32.920 --> 00:02:33.590
Who are you?

00:02:33.810 --> 00:02:37.830
Hi there! I'm Aladdin, 
a lone wolf who travels the desert!

00:02:37.830 --> 00:02:39.050
Nice to meet ya!

00:02:40.220 --> 00:02:43.170
Boss, you shouldn't take that.

00:02:43.170 --> 00:02:44.970
Something smells fishy here.

00:02:50.970 --> 00:02:53.610
I feel so alive!

00:02:54.810 --> 00:02:57.000
I'm glad I could help her out!

00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:58.690
Anyway, I'm off!

00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:02.770
What was that about?

00:03:02.770 --> 00:03:05.330
But now I'm going to live!

00:03:05.540 --> 00:03:07.520
I really do feel like I've come back to life!

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:09.140
I feel so light!

00:03:09.140 --> 00:03:10.620
Look! Look!

00:03:10.620 --> 00:03:12.120
Um, Reina...

00:03:12.660 --> 00:03:13.500
What is it?

00:03:13.850 --> 00:03:15.570
Where's the Walled Garden Kingdom?

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:22.850
This is a pretty nice book.

00:03:22.850 --> 00:03:25.070
I bet it'll fetch a fortune.

00:03:26.410 --> 00:03:29.820
She was so pretty, though...

00:03:29.820 --> 00:03:33.790
If I see her again, I'd like to do
 all kinds of things with her.

00:03:34.430 --> 00:03:37.480
How about this, for instance?

00:03:39.650 --> 00:03:41.900
Wow, that was pretty hard.

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:43.960
He deserves worse than a slap.

00:03:43.960 --> 00:03:46.120
Let's just bury him in the sand.

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:47.960
Aladdin, was it?

00:03:47.960 --> 00:03:50.790
You've got guts to steal from me!

00:03:51.070 --> 00:03:52.900
And you're about to learn just how—

00:03:52.900 --> 00:03:54.000
Beautiful...

00:03:54.930 --> 00:03:57.040
That slap of yours made me tingle all over!

00:03:58.180 --> 00:04:00.380
I've never met anyone like you!

00:04:00.620 --> 00:04:02.970
Your name... Will you tell me your name?

00:04:03.450 --> 00:04:05.180
R-Reina...

00:04:05.380 --> 00:04:07.960
Reina! No, Miss Reina!

00:04:07.960 --> 00:04:11.520
You must be the girl I'm fated to be with!

00:04:11.910 --> 00:04:12.930
I'm so glad!

00:04:12.930 --> 00:04:15.550
Now my fate will go back 
to how it's supposed to be!

00:04:15.550 --> 00:04:16.650
How it's supposed to be?

00:04:16.840 --> 00:04:19.370
It's terrible!

00:04:19.370 --> 00:04:21.820
The sultan stole my magic lamp.

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:24.240
Can you tell me more?

00:04:24.900 --> 00:04:27.740
Sure. Anything you want, Miss Reina!

00:04:32.060 --> 00:04:35.410
Once upon a time, there was 
a young man named Aladdin.

00:04:36.480 --> 00:04:42.510
He was tricked by an evil wizard
 who him locked in a cave!

00:04:43.630 --> 00:04:49.280
He was helpless until he found an 
old lamp in the depths of the cave!

00:04:50.280 --> 00:04:53.820
He rubbed it, and out came a genie!

00:04:53.820 --> 00:04:55.430
Then, the genie said,

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:58.100
"I am the Genie of the Lamp."

00:04:58.100 --> 00:05:02.230
"I shall grant any wish your heart desires."

00:05:03.230 --> 00:05:07.550
So Aladdin used the genie's 
magic to escape the cave

00:05:07.550 --> 00:05:10.370
and become rich!

00:05:11.060 --> 00:05:12.750
But then...

00:05:12.940 --> 00:05:17.000
The sultan heard the rumors 
about the lamp and stole it!

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:19.540
And now I'm broke!

00:05:19.540 --> 00:05:23.480
Wow, you had an OP item like that 
and you still got it stolen from you?

00:05:23.480 --> 00:05:24.760
That's pathetic.

00:05:24.760 --> 00:05:26.840
There was nothing I could do!

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:30.190
The Genie of the Lamp is easily provoked...

00:05:30.190 --> 00:05:32.350
So what does your Book of Fate
 say should happen?

00:05:33.180 --> 00:05:38.860
It says I get the lamp back
 and marry a beautiful princess.

00:05:38.860 --> 00:05:42.110
But the sultan kicked me 
out of town, and here I am.

00:05:43.090 --> 00:05:45.120
A beautiful princess, huh?

00:05:45.120 --> 00:05:48.300
It must be you, Miss Reina!

00:05:48.850 --> 00:05:50.900
I don't know about marrying you,

00:05:50.900 --> 00:05:54.750
but I think it's pretty clear that 
this is Aladdin's Story Zone.

00:05:54.980 --> 00:05:58.790
Sounds like the magic lamp is the key.

00:05:58.790 --> 00:05:59.800
Yeah.

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:02.000
Let's hurry to the sultan.

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:03.050
Will you take us to him?

00:06:03.230 --> 00:06:04.590
Of course!

00:06:04.590 --> 00:06:10.500
I was actually on my way to the 
capital to get it back myself, but...

00:06:11.550 --> 00:06:12.260
But?

00:06:12.510 --> 00:06:15.790
The sun's setting, so we should make camp.

00:06:15.790 --> 00:06:17.100
No. Look.

00:06:17.350 --> 00:06:19.860
That color isn't just twilight.

00:06:19.860 --> 00:06:20.680
Don't tell me...

00:06:20.680 --> 00:06:23.270
This Story Zone is nearing collapse.

00:06:23.490 --> 00:06:25.450
Story Zone? Collapse?

00:06:25.450 --> 00:06:26.540
What are you talking about?

00:06:26.540 --> 00:06:28.400
You don't need to worry about it.

00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:30.350
Let's hurry, Aladdin.

00:06:30.350 --> 00:06:31.340
Sure!

00:06:31.340 --> 00:06:34.300
You're so beautiful when you're mean!

00:06:39.290 --> 00:06:41.870
It's not like the daytime at all!

00:06:41.870 --> 00:06:45.580
They say the desert gets cold at night.

00:06:46.050 --> 00:06:47.330
I'm freezing.

00:06:47.330 --> 00:06:49.300
I think we should make camp.

00:06:49.630 --> 00:06:54.710
No, we can't rest when the 
Story Zone is collapsing.

00:06:54.710 --> 00:06:57.000
We need to keep going.

00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:58.880
Are you okay, Miss Reina?

00:06:58.880 --> 00:07:00.780
You look pale.

00:07:00.780 --> 00:07:03.110
I'm fine... I'm just fine.

00:07:03.470 --> 00:07:07.700
I can't... stop...

00:07:11.350 --> 00:07:12.290
Miss!

00:07:12.290 --> 00:07:13.140
Reina!

00:07:17.280 --> 00:07:19.620
We were lucky to find an oasis here.

00:07:19.870 --> 00:07:21.130
It saved us.

00:07:21.840 --> 00:07:24.420
This place is like my backyard!

00:07:24.940 --> 00:07:26.550
Will Reina be okay?

00:07:26.770 --> 00:07:29.090
She just overdid it.

00:07:29.090 --> 00:07:31.360
She'll be okay with some rest.

00:07:31.360 --> 00:07:32.600
No...

00:07:32.600 --> 00:07:33.340
Reina?

00:07:33.580 --> 00:07:37.510
The Chaos Teller... Hurry... I need to...

00:07:37.740 --> 00:07:39.710
She's talking in her sleep.

00:07:39.710 --> 00:07:44.000
Um, why is Miss Reina pushing herself so hard?

00:07:44.640 --> 00:07:46.960
I've been wondering the same thing.

00:07:46.960 --> 00:07:48.030
Yeah.

00:07:48.280 --> 00:07:51.190
I guess it's time to tell you, kid.

00:07:51.190 --> 00:07:56.080
She wants revenge against the 
Chaos Tellers for destroying her home.

00:07:56.340 --> 00:07:57.720
Her home?

00:07:57.720 --> 00:07:58.330
Yeah.

00:07:58.560 --> 00:08:02.250
She was originally the 
princess of some Story Zone.

00:08:02.250 --> 00:08:06.340
She had a blank book, but lived happily.

00:08:06.650 --> 00:08:09.050
And a Chaos Teller destroyed that?

00:08:09.320 --> 00:08:13.840
That Loki guy was the one behind it.

00:08:16.840 --> 00:08:20.180
That's all we know about it, though.

00:08:20.180 --> 00:08:23.820
She doesn't like talking about it.

00:08:24.920 --> 00:08:26.410
What is it, Aladdin?

00:08:26.410 --> 00:08:27.690
I've made up my mind!

00:08:27.910 --> 00:08:31.690
I'll help you defeat that Chaos Teller!

00:08:32.620 --> 00:08:34.410
But you don't even know what a...

00:08:34.410 --> 00:08:36.350
I don't have a clue what a Chaos Teller is!

00:08:36.350 --> 00:08:40.700
But if it's scaring Miss Reina,
 I'll make it regret that!

00:08:40.960 --> 00:08:41.950
Aladdin...

00:08:41.950 --> 00:08:44.710
And if she's a princess,

00:08:44.710 --> 00:08:49.090
then she really was meant to be my wife!

00:08:49.090 --> 00:08:52.760
I was impressed for a minute, 
but he's really just an idiot.

00:08:52.760 --> 00:08:54.490
Now, now, Shane...

00:08:58.580 --> 00:08:59.450
What was that?

00:08:59.450 --> 00:09:02.220
Twenty of them... No, thirty.

00:09:02.510 --> 00:09:03.580
What's wrong?

00:09:03.580 --> 00:09:06.170
It's because the Story Zone is falling apart.

00:09:06.170 --> 00:09:09.230
Yeah. These villains were born from the void.

00:09:09.510 --> 00:09:11.560
Aladdin, take care of Reina.

00:09:12.190 --> 00:09:13.650
O-Okay.

00:09:13.910 --> 00:09:15.910
Our healer's taking a little nap,

00:09:15.910 --> 00:09:17.370
so make sure you don't get hurt.

00:09:17.370 --> 00:09:18.410
Roger.

00:09:18.670 --> 00:09:19.410
Let's go!

00:09:20.910 --> 00:09:22.080
Connect!

00:09:32.540 --> 00:09:34.630
What are these monsters?!

00:09:36.530 --> 00:09:39.610
My genie will take care of them!

00:09:40.030 --> 00:09:43.250
Wait, the sultan stole it!

00:09:50.770 --> 00:09:56.150
E-Even without the lamp, 
I'll protect Miss Reina!

00:09:59.450 --> 00:10:00.510
Take this!

00:10:04.440 --> 00:10:06.370
I won't let you lay a finger on her!

00:10:08.290 --> 00:10:09.470
Get down!

00:10:16.820 --> 00:10:18.190
Miss Reina!

00:10:18.190 --> 00:10:19.310
Thank you...

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:22.470
For protecting me.

00:10:22.740 --> 00:10:24.100
But I didn't do anything.

00:10:24.100 --> 00:10:25.910
You saved me.

00:10:25.910 --> 00:10:28.670
You're so strong!

00:10:28.670 --> 00:10:31.600
I just used the power of a hero.

00:10:31.600 --> 00:10:33.110
I'm not the one who's strong.

00:10:33.110 --> 00:10:35.520
No. No matter whose strength it is,

00:10:35.520 --> 00:10:39.610
what's important is how you use it!

00:10:40.090 --> 00:10:41.370
How you use it?

00:10:41.370 --> 00:10:42.410
That's right!

00:10:42.410 --> 00:10:46.050
You can see what happened to me after
 I relied too much on the power of the lamp.

00:10:46.050 --> 00:10:48.030
You need to use your powers wisely!

00:10:48.670 --> 00:10:50.100
That's a smart thing to say.

00:10:50.980 --> 00:10:52.500
Now get some rest...

00:10:55.650 --> 00:10:59.240
There's... another one...

00:11:01.300 --> 00:11:02.510
Miss Reina!

00:11:08.880 --> 00:11:11.850
I won't let you... lay a finger on her...

00:11:12.870 --> 00:11:13.860
Aladdin...

00:11:21.610 --> 00:11:22.570
Are you okay?!

00:11:24.070 --> 00:11:25.050
Missy!

00:11:25.050 --> 00:11:27.120
I'm fine! But...

00:11:28.450 --> 00:11:31.310
I made it in time...

00:11:31.310 --> 00:11:32.170
Aladdin!

00:11:32.430 --> 00:11:35.090
I don't need a magic lamp...

00:11:35.090 --> 00:11:38.210
to make my wish come true, do I?

00:11:38.540 --> 00:11:40.980
If I can protect the person I love...

00:11:40.980 --> 00:11:42.460
Don't speak!

00:11:42.460 --> 00:11:44.560
I'll use my healing magic right away...

00:11:44.560 --> 00:11:50.800
This is... the fate... I chose.

00:11:59.350 --> 00:12:01.070
Boss, it's not going to work.

00:12:01.730 --> 00:12:03.700
Aladdin is already...

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:05.900
This can't be happening...

00:12:06.880 --> 00:12:08.400
Damn it all...

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:13.900
Aladdin...

00:12:29.200 --> 00:12:33.880
Did this happen because he got 
involved with us and our blank books?

00:12:33.880 --> 00:12:38.610
Maybe. But it was his choice to protect her.

00:12:38.930 --> 00:12:40.770
He was an impressive kid.

00:12:40.770 --> 00:12:43.590
But if Reina does her tuning, then he'll...

00:12:43.590 --> 00:12:45.700
You know the truth, don't you, kid?

00:12:45.960 --> 00:12:49.920
Tuning just restores the story
 to its proper form.

00:12:49.920 --> 00:12:51.650
It doesn't turn back time.

00:12:51.650 --> 00:12:53.910
So even if we do the tuning now...

00:12:54.230 --> 00:12:57.670
It won't bring back Aladdin as we knew him.

00:12:57.670 --> 00:13:00.500
Someone else very similar will 
become the main character in his place.

00:13:00.800 --> 00:13:01.850
That's terrible!

00:13:01.850 --> 00:13:06.610
To the Storyteller, 
as long as the roles are fulfilled,

00:13:06.610 --> 00:13:08.990
it doesn't matter who the main character is.

00:13:08.990 --> 00:13:12.910
They don't care much about human lives.

00:13:13.920 --> 00:13:17.900
But you know, his wish came true, 
even without his magic lamp.

00:13:17.900 --> 00:13:20.270
He got to die a hero.

00:13:20.650 --> 00:13:22.220
His magic lamp...

00:13:24.710 --> 00:13:25.360
That's it!

00:13:25.620 --> 00:13:26.320
What is?

00:13:26.560 --> 00:13:30.200
The magic lamp could bring him back to life!

00:13:30.910 --> 00:13:32.250
I see.

00:13:32.250 --> 00:13:35.040
Yeah, it's worth a try!

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:38.480
You're right, Ex!
 Let's hurry to the capital.

00:13:38.480 --> 00:13:40.340
But are you feeling okay, Reina?

00:13:40.790 --> 00:13:42.280
I'm fine now.

00:13:42.280 --> 00:13:45.390
Besides, Aladdin's life is at stake!

00:13:46.740 --> 00:13:48.820
Yeah... I'm fine.

00:13:48.820 --> 00:13:51.240
I'm going to bring Aladdin back!

00:13:53.220 --> 00:13:55.220
What's that strange color in the sky?

00:13:55.220 --> 00:13:56.850
It's probably a bad omen!

00:13:56.850 --> 00:13:57.970
What's going on?

00:13:57.970 --> 00:13:59.610
This wasn't in my Book of Fate!

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:01.440
Let's hurry to the sultan.

00:14:01.710 --> 00:14:02.420
Right!

00:14:02.420 --> 00:14:03.650
Understood.

00:14:04.550 --> 00:14:07.200
This is the place. Let's bust our way in!

00:14:07.340 --> 00:14:11.310
Yeah. We'll get the lamp back 
from the sultan, no matter the cost!

00:14:11.310 --> 00:14:16.370
My, my... I'm surprised to see you all here.

00:14:16.570 --> 00:14:17.960
Him again?

00:14:17.960 --> 00:14:18.710
Loki...

00:14:19.050 --> 00:14:22.610
I knew you were the one behind this!

00:14:22.610 --> 00:14:25.880
My, my... So you suspect me, do you?

00:14:26.690 --> 00:14:29.010
Well, you'd be right.

00:14:29.280 --> 00:14:31.210
We don't have time for you!

00:14:31.210 --> 00:14:34.350
We're here to get the lamp 
back from the sultan!

00:14:35.310 --> 00:14:39.350
So you're looking for the sultan?
Or rather, the Chaos Teller?

00:14:40.140 --> 00:14:41.270
I knew it!

00:14:41.540 --> 00:14:46.610
Loki, you tricked the sultan into stealing 
the lamp from Aladdin, didn't you?

00:14:47.050 --> 00:14:51.300
Brilliant deduction, Priestess of Tuning!

00:14:51.300 --> 00:14:52.660
Right again you are.

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:54.840
Then Aladdin's death was also...

00:14:54.840 --> 00:14:56.410
It's all his fault.

00:14:56.600 --> 00:15:00.200
However, I do think you should hurry.

00:15:01.490 --> 00:15:02.460
See?

00:15:02.900 --> 00:15:05.610
The Story Zone is starting to collapse.

00:15:05.610 --> 00:15:09.300
You... You'll pay for this.

00:15:09.580 --> 00:15:13.940
You took my home, 
the person I loved, and Aladdin!

00:15:13.940 --> 00:15:14.810
You'll pay!

00:15:15.200 --> 00:15:19.060
My, my. You hate me, is that it?

00:15:19.290 --> 00:15:20.390
Of course I do!

00:15:20.390 --> 00:15:24.280
So it's been hatred that's 
driven you all this time?

00:15:24.800 --> 00:15:26.940
Nothing but your anger towards me?

00:15:28.870 --> 00:15:33.480
How I pity the people of the 
Story Zones you've tuned.

00:15:33.480 --> 00:15:35.830
You stole the freedom they had

00:15:35.830 --> 00:15:39.580
and forced them back into their 
roles assigned by the Storyteller.

00:15:39.890 --> 00:15:44.340
And for what? All because of the 
personal grudge you hold against me?

00:15:45.260 --> 00:15:47.050
How arrogant!

00:15:47.050 --> 00:15:48.010
You shut your mouth!

00:15:48.280 --> 00:15:51.860
Reina's worked really hard to protect 
the people of these Story Zones!

00:15:51.860 --> 00:15:54.150
It wasn't hate that drove her!

00:15:54.150 --> 00:15:55.560
The kid's right!

00:15:55.560 --> 00:15:59.600
Want us to beat you senseless 
so you can't talk anymore?

00:16:00.980 --> 00:16:02.190
My... How very, very frightening.

00:16:03.510 --> 00:16:05.520
Abracadabra!

00:16:08.820 --> 00:16:09.440
What's this?!

00:16:10.130 --> 00:16:11.280
When did we...

00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:12.430
Where are we?

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:20.000
I brought you here with the power
 of the Genie of the Lamp.

00:16:22.760 --> 00:16:23.570
That's...

00:16:23.570 --> 00:16:24.630
The magic lamp!

00:16:24.870 --> 00:16:26.970
That belonged to Aladdin!

00:16:26.970 --> 00:16:28.000
Give it back!

00:16:28.250 --> 00:16:30.300
Nonsense, little girl!

00:16:30.300 --> 00:16:33.630
Everything in this world belongs to me!

00:16:33.880 --> 00:16:37.070
Well, I guess we shouldn't 
have expected that to work.

00:16:37.070 --> 00:16:39.310
Let's just beat him up.

00:16:40.800 --> 00:16:42.060
Fools!

00:16:42.060 --> 00:16:46.660
Genie of the Lamp, destroy them all!

00:16:48.640 --> 00:16:51.510
Of course, master!

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:55.920
That's...

00:16:55.920 --> 00:16:57.410
The Genie of the Lamp?

00:16:57.410 --> 00:16:58.780
Let's go, everyone!

00:16:59.060 --> 00:17:00.700
Snow White!

00:17:00.900 --> 00:17:02.020
Goliath!

00:17:02.550 --> 00:17:03.750
Gerda!

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:05.420
Kai!

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:06.920
Connect!

00:17:14.290 --> 00:17:17.030
I don't need kindness.

00:17:18.320 --> 00:17:19.900
Everyone, let's go.

00:17:22.830 --> 00:17:25.560
I won't let you take another step!

00:17:30.940 --> 00:17:32.030
You okay, missy?

00:17:32.360 --> 00:17:34.130
He's so powerful...

00:17:34.130 --> 00:17:34.650
Shane!

00:17:34.940 --> 00:17:35.950
Leave it to me!

00:17:36.660 --> 00:17:38.300
Abracadabra!

00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:41.360
He split in two?!

00:17:42.030 --> 00:17:43.330
How do we beat him?

00:17:43.330 --> 00:17:45.120
I won't hold back!

00:17:45.400 --> 00:17:47.140
Here I go!

00:17:47.140 --> 00:17:49.540
I know! Remember what Aladdin said?

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:52.640
The Genie of the Lamp is easily provoked!

00:17:52.640 --> 00:17:54.050
I see!

00:17:54.350 --> 00:17:56.470
Pin them down, everyone!

00:17:56.700 --> 00:17:57.690
Leave it to me!

00:17:57.690 --> 00:17:59.090
Okay!

00:18:01.500 --> 00:18:03.330
Hey, you big wimp!

00:18:03.330 --> 00:18:06.390
You split in two because 
you're scared of us!

00:18:06.600 --> 00:18:10.060
Now that there's two of you, 
we can handle you ourselves!

00:18:11.220 --> 00:18:13.350
You think so, do you?

00:18:14.660 --> 00:18:16.460
Abracadabra!

00:18:16.630 --> 00:18:18.410
Abracadabra!

00:18:21.790 --> 00:18:24.040
Boss, get the sultan now!

00:18:24.040 --> 00:18:24.700
On it!

00:18:25.920 --> 00:18:27.540
Prepare to die, sultan!

00:18:35.370 --> 00:18:38.380
Did you think I would depend 
on the power of the genie?

00:18:39.440 --> 00:18:40.530
Aladdin...

00:18:42.430 --> 00:18:44.530
Lend me your strength!

00:18:48.310 --> 00:18:50.440
Frozen World!

00:18:59.600 --> 00:19:02.790
Oh? Farewell, master.

00:19:07.980 --> 00:19:08.790
We did it!

00:19:10.660 --> 00:19:13.130
I need to hurry and use the lamp...

00:19:15.080 --> 00:19:16.230
We did it, Reina!

00:19:16.230 --> 00:19:18.430
Now we can get Aladdin back!

00:19:24.210 --> 00:19:25.330
Why...?

00:19:25.330 --> 00:19:29.510
It's probably because the sultan 
abused the power of the lamp.

00:19:37.530 --> 00:19:39.520
This is bad...

00:19:39.520 --> 00:19:41.570
The whole damn Story Zone's falling apart!

00:19:42.930 --> 00:19:45.490
Wait! If you do the tuning 
now, Aladdin will...

00:19:45.920 --> 00:19:48.000
Hate me if you want.

00:19:49.030 --> 00:19:50.870
He chose his own path

00:19:51.470 --> 00:19:55.290
over the fate he was given.

00:19:55.760 --> 00:19:59.670
The choices of others are 
the only reason we're alive.

00:19:59.890 --> 00:20:00.630
But...

00:20:00.940 --> 00:20:04.450
I can't waste the life he chose to give me.

00:20:05.220 --> 00:20:09.240
What's important now
 is how I use the power I have...

00:20:11.800 --> 00:20:12.800
Reina!

00:20:17.480 --> 00:20:21.200
I'm sorry, Aladdin...

00:20:25.740 --> 00:20:28.660
Teller of tales, 
drowned in a maelstrom of chaos...

00:20:29.230 --> 00:20:34.080
By my words, I now begin the tuning...

00:20:44.980 --> 00:20:47.970
Prince Aladdin is here!

00:20:55.330 --> 00:20:58.110
So what exactly did we do?

00:20:58.320 --> 00:21:01.000
The new sultan's really young, huh?

00:21:01.000 --> 00:21:04.240
He's marrying the daughter 
of the last sultan, right?

00:21:04.240 --> 00:21:06.600
Man, am I jealous!

00:21:06.600 --> 00:21:08.380
We saved the lives of the 
hundreds and thousands

00:21:08.380 --> 00:21:10.160
of the people who live in this Story Zone.

00:21:10.600 --> 00:21:12.370
That's enough, right?

00:21:15.010 --> 00:21:17.800
Okay, it's time to go.

00:21:17.800 --> 00:21:19.290
Huh? Where's Reina?

00:21:23.930 --> 00:21:26.550
She doesn't like showing 
how she feels, after all...

00:21:27.370 --> 00:21:28.300
I...

00:21:29.050 --> 00:21:35.000
I just... want to take some of the 
burden she's carrying from her.

00:21:48.060 --> 00:21:50.910
<i>Even if everyone in this Story Zone does,</i>

00:21:51.350 --> 00:21:54.910
<i>I will never forget you.</i>

00:21:55.690 --> 00:21:56.790
<i>Never.</i>

00:21:58.800 --> 00:22:02.300
Seems you had another fun adventure.

00:22:02.590 --> 00:22:06.180
Yes. I wanted to stay a little longer, 
so I'm a bit disappointed.

00:22:06.400 --> 00:22:08.800
I wanted to go, too...

00:22:09.710 --> 00:22:10.890
Now, now... Don't be silly.

00:22:11.160 --> 00:22:15.930
You have your duties to tend to as 
the Priestess of Chaos, Lady Curly.

00:22:17.440 --> 00:22:18.790
That's right.

00:22:18.790 --> 00:22:20.550
It's finally time...

00:22:20.550 --> 00:22:23.400
for the ritual we've waited
 so long for to begin.

00:22:26.140 --> 00:22:28.160
We will put an end to the old tales,

00:22:28.450 --> 00:22:31.080
and write new stories of our own!

00:22:33.550 --> 00:22:35.950
New stories of our own!
